8px\"><div class=\"line\">RULE &quot;a &#39;b&#39; &lt;c&gt;&quot;</div><div class=\"description\">a\nb�c\td</div></div>\n<ul>\n<li><div class=\"node leaf\" style=\"background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #5f6368\"><div class=\"line\">`k&amp;y` != &quot;&lt;x&gt;&quot;</div></div></li>\n<li><div class=\"node output\" style=\"background:#f3e8fd;border:1px solid #9334e6\"><div class=\"line\">THEN &quot;out \\&quot;1\\&quot;&quot; = &quot;&#39;q&#39;&quot;</div></div></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n"
